WEBVTT

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:41.210
Son Goku, next time,
I'll defeat you for sure!

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.660
Who is it!?

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:09.350
W- who are you!?

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.010
Finish him!

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.900
<i>Piccolo and Kami are
of one body and mind.</i>

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:30.060
<i>Now, Kami is dead, too.</i>

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.940
Piccolo has been beaten!
Was it Son Goku?

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.070
No, it couldn't have been...

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.040
I- it couldn't be!

00:01:55.590 --> 00:02:00.900
<i>Break through the shining clouds,
and fly away (fly away)</i>

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:07.910
<i>As a panorama spreads itself
throughout my being!</i>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:13.240
<i>The earth, having been kicked
in the face, gets angry (angry)!</i>

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:19.920
<i>And makes one of its
volcanoes explode!</i>

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:26.590
<i>If, within the thawed polar ice,</i>

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:35.600
<i>There is a dinosaur, then I want
to train him to balance atop a ball.</i>

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:39.270
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:48.310
<i>No matter what may happen,
I feel as though nothing can bother me,</i>

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.650
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:57.660
<i>However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!</i>

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.930
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:09.930
<i>The emptier your head is, the more
room there is to pack with dreams,</i>

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:13.270
<i>CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA</i>

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:20.610
<i>With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...</i>

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.040
<i>Sparking!</i>

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.870
The 17-year cicada
can have a larval stage

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:52.010
of 17 years or 13 years, huh?

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:55.210
So they're in the ground
for 17 whole years!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.510
That must be rough.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:01.820
Gohan-<i>chan!</i> Time to eat!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:05.450
Mother is in good spirits today.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.870
Hey! Gohan!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:17.000
It's Grandpa!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.870
Pa!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.340
Gohan, are you doin' all right?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:24.340
Mm-hmm!
You're looking good too, Grandpa.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.010
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.880
Here's some presents for you!

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:29.350
Wow! Thank you!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:32.620
Chichi said that books would
make good presents for you,

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.450
but they're so bulky to be carryin'.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.190
Pa, what are you kiddin' around for?

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:51.370
Pa? What's the matter?

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.130
Grandpa!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.540
Pa!

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.240
Mother!

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.260
W- who are you!?

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.900
What do you want with us!?

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:28.070
I've come for the Dragon Ball
on top of that kid's head.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.040
Gohan, get in the house!

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.340
Mother!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:37.180
--Mother!
--Hurry up!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:42.920
Mother!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.860
Gohan!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:16.120
Mother!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:21.310
Chichi!

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:25.100
Mother!

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.830
G- Gohan...

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:30.130
Gohan... run away...

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:46.010
Chichi!

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:49.850
W- what happened, Chichi!?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:56.790
G- Goku-<i>sa,</i> Gohan
has been kidnapped...

00:06:56.790 --> 00:07:00.000
Gohan? Who took Gohan!?

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.470
I don't know.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:04.800
They came for the Dragon Ball...

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.140
The Dragon Ball!?

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:09.270
Where did they go!? Chichi!

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:20.450
This makes five that we've
brought together, right?

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:22.150
Yes, sir!

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:25.420
Then there are two left.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.960
Ginger, once I have all seven together,

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:32.130
I can ask of Shen Long and
receive eternal life, right?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.130
Yes, sir.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:34.470
Two more, huh?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.470
Once we learn the location
of the last two,

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.840
the rest will be a
piece of cake for us.

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:45.310
Even Kami will die, but I will
become everlastingly immortal.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:49.210
That will be the first step
of my revenge.

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.350
The time has arrived when I will
plunge all living creatures

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:57.050
on the face of the earth
into misery and despair!

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.800
I want to go home now!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:08.470
Shut up! You be quiet,
or I'll never take you back!

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:10.940
My father is going to come save me!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:14.310
My father is Son Goku,
the strongest person in the world!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.570
What's that? Son Goku?

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.480
The same Son Goku that defeated

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:22.150
Piccolo Daimao in the
Tenkaichi Tournament?

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:25.170
That's right! I'm Son Goku's son!

00:08:27.220 --> 00:08:29.810
You're quite a crybaby, considering!

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:37.060
And as for Piccolo,
we defeated him, too.

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.060
Yeah, and it was easy!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.360
He was a pushover!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:53.240
<i>Impossible! I can sense a
mysterious power coming from him!</i>

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:56.080
<i>I've never felt a power like this!</i>

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:59.550
<i>Depending on how he is fostered,
he could be of great use to me.</i>

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:03.020
I know! I'll make you
one of my attendants!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.150
An attendant?

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:10.520
Wow, are you lucky!
You got off without getting killed!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:15.530
Grow stronger here, like these others!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.400
Stronger?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.540
It ain't Gohan they're after.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.200
It's the Dragon Balls.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.210
They've already gotten
five of them together.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.080
I'm sure that's where he must be.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.220
Here, huh?

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.080
Mm-hmm, to the south.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.920
That's near the Crimson Sea.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.260
I'm going to borrow the Dragon Radar!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.560
Fine.

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:44.230
Goku! These guys were able to beat up
Gyumao and Chichi with ease!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.230
Be on your guard!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.220
Right!

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:49.560
Son-<i>kun,</i> be careful!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:57.600
Goku...

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:01.310
Hold up!

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:03.610
No way! I'm hopping around!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:10.440
That's enough! Why should I
have to baby-sit that brat!?

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:15.960
Why, you...

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:23.300
I'm thirsty. I'm hungry, too.

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:26.170
Don't! You can't eat that!

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:28.970
But you ate it.

00:10:33.180 --> 00:10:34.300
Delicious!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:38.220
Ah, that was delicious!

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.510
When children eat those...

00:10:42.520 --> 00:10:45.050
...they become inebriated...

00:10:50.900 --> 00:10:52.360
Ah, geez...

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:02.170
Hey, come on! Just- just a minute, now!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:10.470
<i>Way, way, way up in the sky,
a whale was swimming along.</i>

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:18.240
<i>He blew out up through his spout,
and it turned into rain.</i>

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:25.460
<i>A thun- thun- thundercloud came along.
Oh, it's really an octopus!</i>

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:31.870
<i>The sun was so surprised,
he roasted it all up!</i>

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.160
Wait up, I tell you!
<i>The sun was so surprised,
he roasted it all up!</i>

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:34.810
<i>The sun was so surprised,
he roasted it all up!</i>

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:40.540
<i>Then a dinosaur ate the octopus
as it floated away.</i>

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:49.480
<i>So good, so good, I don't know why,
but I feel so very good.</i>

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:57.420
<i>So good, so good, I don't know why,
but I'm so very glad.</i>

00:11:58.930 --> 00:11:59.900
Hey!

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.370
Be a good boy and stand still!
<i>And when I'm feeling good,
I'm smart as well!</i>

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.670
<i>And when I'm feeling good,
I'm smart as well!</i>

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.540
<i>I can see other kinds of worlds!</i>

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.910
He's no ordinary child, all right.
<i>I can see other kinds of worlds!</i>

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:20.380
<i>I don't even have to study,
and I can see other cool worlds!</i>

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.840
<i>I am the greatest genius
under the sun!</i>

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.550
Good grief, what a troublesome child!

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:41.030
Garlic Jr-<i>sama,</i> here are the last two!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:53.350
This is all of them now, right?
Then let's have Shen Long grant my wish.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.260
There it is!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.320
Come forth, dragon!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.170
They're calling on Shen Long!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.470
Now, speak thy wish.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:52.000
I will grant thee any one wish.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:56.480
Give me eternal life!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.470
That is a simple matter.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:28.500
Miserable humans! As of now,
I am the ruler of the world!

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:35.290
Evil spirits, lurking in the darkness,
as you are freed from your spells,

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.490
be reborn from your subjugation!

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:43.950
Rain blood mercilessly
over the entire world!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:51.570
I shall now reign over this world,
with no end to my life!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:58.530
Humans! This terror will continue
until every last one of you obeys me!

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:07.350
I have granted thy wish.

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:12.250
Farewell!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:32.540
Now, I have nothing left to fear!
I will carry out my father's vengeance,

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:36.480
by killing all of the humans that
were given their light by Kami,

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:41.850
and doing with this world as I please!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.580
Behold, our Garlic Jr-<i>sama!</i>

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:54.570
Banzai! Banzai!

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.090
Give me back my Gohan!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:00.400
Give me back my Gohan!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.510
You must be Son Goku, right?

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.640
That's right!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:10.140
You hurt Old Man Gyumao and Chichi!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.220
And we're going to hurt you, too!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.210
What?

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.430
Kami!?

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:32.270
You mean, Piccolo didn't die?

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:35.270
Kami-<i>sama,</i> mind your own business!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:38.260
Ah, Son Goku, you're the same as ever.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:40.580
Welcome, Kami.

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.680
So, it is you, Garlic.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:45.120
You've come back after
300 years, have you?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:50.620
You'll use any means to accomplish
your schemes, just like your father.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.620
What?

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.960
As was the father, so is the son.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:58.160
Indeed, your father competed
against me for the throne of Kami,

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.430
but I was the one who
was chosen as successor.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:07.930
The previous Kami had seen
through Garlic's schemes.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.550
Dissatisfied with the decision,
Garlic rebelled against Kami,

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:23.490
and as a result, he had his power
sealed away by Kami.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.860
His final words were that in 300 years,

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.930
he would make certain
to take his revenge.

00:17:34.930 --> 00:17:37.270
But who would have thought
that he would be so vengeful

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.840
as to entrust his retribution to his son?

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:43.340
Hmph! If you hadn't ascended
to the throne of Kami,

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:47.340
you wouldn't have to
die for my vengeance.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:48.850
This ain't got anything to do with me!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:50.350
Where is Gohan!?

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:53.080
Your dirty brat is still asleep.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.880
Inside there?

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:03.280
We won't allow it!

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:22.440
Gohan!

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:30.850
If you want to come up these stairs,
you'll have to defeat us first!

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:34.020
Ginger, one of the Three Patrons of Garlic.

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.190
Nikki, likewise.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:38.420
Sansho, likewise.

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:01.480
All right, come on!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.120
Shogayaki!!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.790
Nodoame!!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.420
Unaju!!

00:19:48.260 --> 00:19:52.370
Not bad. You've gotten bigger,
and yet your speed has increased, too!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.060
Follow me!

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:03.610
You think a Kami will die so easily?

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:08.080
I have been given
eternal life by Shen Long.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:11.210
There is no way I can be beaten.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.610
Why you arrogant fool!

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:20.860
That technique ain't going to work on me!

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:39.310
Where is Gohan!?

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.020
--What?
--What?

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:01.840
Kuririn!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:04.430
You're acting pretty aloof, Goku!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.910
But I'm sure there's one other...

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.910
Son! Don't forget
that I'm here, too!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.550
Piccolo!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.020
What are you doing here?

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:36.200
It's not as though I came to help you.
I owe these guys one.

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.030
Gohan!

00:22:03.030 --> 00:22:04.190
Oh, no!

00:22:33.930 --> 00:22:35.090
Gohan!

00:22:37.930 --> 00:22:39.060
Not so fast!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:41.440
Kuririn, take care of Gohan!

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:42.530
Y- you got it!

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:01.050
I won't let you!

00:23:10.230 --> 00:23:12.220
I'm going to pay you back in full.

00:23:29.450 --> 00:23:33.460
Can't you fight me, unless all
three of you take me by surprise?

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:37.620
You must be joking! I'm more than
enough to take care of you myself!

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:45.300
Don't you have any
better power than that?

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:10.290
You're a monster!

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:15.450
You guys are insignificant by yourselves.

00:24:37.850 --> 00:24:42.190
After this, I'm going to create
the ideal world of darkness.

00:24:43.330 --> 00:24:45.320
You just relax and go to hell.

00:24:56.240 --> 00:24:58.870
W- why you...

00:25:38.550 --> 00:25:40.070
Extend, Nyoi-bo!

00:26:03.170 --> 00:26:05.400
Kamehame...

00:26:08.040 --> 00:26:09.340
<i>Ha!!</i>

00:26:33.100 --> 00:26:35.570
Nothing is left for old warriors,
but to be wiped out!

00:26:35.570 --> 00:26:38.240
Let this be a lesson
to you from my father!

00:26:38.240 --> 00:26:40.570
And now, I will finish you off!

00:26:48.120 --> 00:26:52.420
I am still Kami over the earth. I know
what kind of misery and misfortune

00:26:52.420 --> 00:26:56.630
will come to the world
with you reigning over it.

00:26:56.630 --> 00:27:00.150
Even if it costs me my life, I will
not allow you to have your way!

00:27:05.230 --> 00:27:09.100
You fool. Are you saying
you would kill us both?

00:27:09.100 --> 00:27:10.240
That's right.

00:27:10.240 --> 00:27:13.500
That may be the one thing
that I am finally capable of.

00:27:16.250 --> 00:27:19.110
You may die, but I will not!

00:27:20.580 --> 00:27:23.280
You may not die, all right...

00:27:25.250 --> 00:27:30.160
...but even if your life goes on,
if you cannot do anything,

00:27:30.160 --> 00:27:32.260
it will indeed be hell for you.

00:27:32.260 --> 00:27:34.590
I will give you a taste
of the pain of hell.

00:27:36.330 --> 00:27:37.990
Piccolo!

00:27:44.010 --> 00:27:46.000
Kuririn! Take care of Gohan!

00:27:47.180 --> 00:27:48.470
Y- you got it!

00:27:52.180 --> 00:27:55.320
What a shame, Son Goku, Piccolo.

00:27:55.320 --> 00:27:57.350
How could folks such as yourselves

00:27:57.350 --> 00:28:00.190
come to the aid of
this withered old Kami!?

00:28:10.130 --> 00:28:12.290
I sense an awesome power...

00:28:32.860 --> 00:28:34.320
Take this!

00:28:40.330 --> 00:28:41.320
Damn...

00:28:43.870 --> 00:28:45.860
Kami-<i>sama,</i> watch on from here.

00:28:46.500 --> 00:28:49.030
I'm counting on you, Goku!

00:29:04.190 --> 00:29:05.480
Piccolo! Make way!

00:30:07.480 --> 00:30:08.470
Dammit!

00:30:31.410 --> 00:30:34.380
Is that all the two of you
together can do?

00:30:34.380 --> 00:30:36.480
Damn, he's got outrageous power!

00:30:36.480 --> 00:30:38.610
If we don't watch it,
we're going to get done in.

00:30:47.590 --> 00:30:50.530
You're taking those off, huh?
He is a dangerous opponent

00:30:50.530 --> 00:30:53.390
for someone who cannot seriously
use all of their power.

00:30:57.370 --> 00:31:00.030
Piccolo, you're wearing
the heavy stuff, too?

00:31:00.540 --> 00:31:04.370
You aren't the only one who's training.

00:31:04.370 --> 00:31:07.510
Who would have thought that
we'd be fighting together?

00:31:07.510 --> 00:31:12.000
Once we defeat him...
your turn comes next!

00:32:05.870 --> 00:32:06.830
Piccolo...

00:32:10.570 --> 00:32:12.900
Piccolo, you...

00:32:13.840 --> 00:32:15.580
You keep out of it!

00:32:15.580 --> 00:32:18.570
Son, now it's our turn to settle things!

00:32:21.280 --> 00:32:25.120
Looks like that's all we can do, huh?

00:32:35.530 --> 00:32:38.260
I told you! I will not die!

00:33:22.580 --> 00:33:23.940
Piccolo!

00:33:35.560 --> 00:33:38.360
Where's Goku's child!?

00:33:38.360 --> 00:33:40.520
Don't tell me he went
through that opening!

00:33:42.060 --> 00:33:43.900
Gohan!

00:33:53.410 --> 00:33:56.240
Why, you! You think you're so clever!

00:34:00.380 --> 00:34:05.820
Let everything be sucked into
this Dead Zone that I have created!

00:34:05.920 --> 00:34:08.390
Not a single ray of light
can penetrate it!

00:34:08.390 --> 00:34:10.230
You will be locked inside
this hell of darkness,

00:34:10.230 --> 00:34:13.060
both body and spirit,
until you are dead!

00:34:16.930 --> 00:34:18.260
Yow!

00:34:41.620 --> 00:34:43.150
Gohan!

00:34:52.470 --> 00:34:53.460
What?

00:35:01.480 --> 00:35:03.140
Gohan!

00:35:06.080 --> 00:35:10.020
That brat! His power is beyond mine!

00:35:13.050 --> 00:35:18.150
What kind of power is that!?
He's no ordinary kid, all right!

00:35:24.570 --> 00:35:27.560
I'll put forth all of my power!

00:36:03.910 --> 00:36:05.240
Gohan!

00:36:08.240 --> 00:36:09.940
Goku!

00:36:10.180 --> 00:36:12.510
Father!

00:36:19.960 --> 00:36:25.390
I will not die!
I have obtained eternal life!

00:37:25.120 --> 00:37:27.490
K- Kami-<i>sama,</i>
what happened to Garlic Jr?

00:37:27.490 --> 00:37:32.330
He fell into the very hell
that he himself created.

00:37:32.330 --> 00:37:39.030
Garlic must go on living
in there forever.

00:37:39.030 --> 00:37:43.560
He probably regrets
gaining eternal life.

00:37:53.050 --> 00:37:54.540
Gohan!

00:37:55.380 --> 00:38:00.220
Ah! Father! You really did
come to save me, huh?

00:38:03.860 --> 00:38:05.860
Gohan, don't you remember?

00:38:05.860 --> 00:38:09.020
My father is the strongest person
in the world, all right.

00:38:18.370 --> 00:38:21.310
Gohan, that was a scary experience, huh?

00:38:21.310 --> 00:38:23.040
Come on, let's go home to your mother.

00:38:43.930 --> 00:38:49.930
Son Goku, someday,
I'll make sure we settle this.

00:38:51.410 --> 00:38:57.550
<i>Garlic Jr's grand schemes have come
to an end, like a dream within a dream,</i>

00:38:57.550 --> 00:39:00.120
<i>thanks to the power
of Goku and the others.</i>

00:39:00.120 --> 00:39:04.090
<i>Goku thought about whether
or not he should tell Chichi</i>

00:39:04.090 --> 00:39:08.780
<i>about how he had been
saved by his son, Gohan...</i>

00:39:12.930 --> 00:39:15.520
<i>Chichi wouldn't believe it anyhow.</i>

00:39:16.160 --> 00:39:19.130
<i>I guess I'll tell Gohan
about it once he grows up.</i>

00:39:46.460 --> 00:39:50.470
<i>Here it comes a-fighting,
an apple-colored monster.</i>

00:39:50.470 --> 00:39:56.470
<i>Here it comes a-fighting,
a nut-scented alien.</i>

00:39:56.470 --> 00:39:58.940
<i>They meet and the
heart beats faster.</i>

00:40:02.140 --> 00:40:07.550
<i>Sparkle, sparkle,
the galaxy's a popcorn shower!</i>

00:40:09.480 --> 00:40:14.020
<i>Yesterday goes
bye, bye, bye (Gohan),</i>

00:40:14.020 --> 00:40:18.030
<i>Mystery
(far as the eye can see),</i>

00:40:18.030 --> 00:40:21.160
<i>Gather up your energy,
(substitutes are okay),</i>

00:40:21.160 --> 00:40:24.290
<i>Come over here, lai, lai, lai</i>

00:40:26.070 --> 00:40:31.530
<i>Ooh, miracle ZENKAI power!</i>

00:40:33.540 --> 00:40:35.540
<i>A hungry, naughty Kinto Un,</i>

00:40:35.540 --> 00:40:37.550
<i>A mountainful of horizons,</i>

00:40:37.550 --> 00:40:39.550
<i>They meet each other, they come apart,
they meet each other, they come apart,</i>

00:40:39.550 --> 00:40:41.550
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:40:41.550 --> 00:40:47.220
<i>Aah, enough!
Even Kami-sama has it rough.</i>

00:40:47.220 --> 00:40:49.220
<i>So sorry.</i>

00:40:49.220 --> 00:40:54.990
<i>Ooh, full-bellied ZENKAI power!</i>

00:40:57.230 --> 00:41:03.100
<i>Come on out,
full-on ZENKAI power!</i>
